cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research project, please cite the author and manuscript."
title: "Lubuimi's Initial Valuation-One Cylinder Theorem"
authors:
  - family-names: Lubuimi
    given-names: Ta-Yoshua
date-released: 2026-11-10
version: "0.1.0"
type: article
abstract: >-
  An exact 2-adic classification of the initial valuation-one run in accelerated
  Syracuse orbits, with exact run length, natural densities, and a signed-offset
  margin recovery threshold. The project also records the general finite
  valuation-word cylinder partition theorem as a companion extension.
keywords:
  - Collatz conjecture
  - Syracuse dynamics
  - 2-adic valuation
  - residue cylinders
  - affine offset identity
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi"
